        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Malaika o ng'wa SEEBA kwilonga Bokimu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Malaika o ng'wa SEEBA wīnga ī Giligaali ūja Bokimu; aho alī kwenūko ūbawīla a Baisilaeli gīkī, “Nakang'wīnja ī Misili nūng'wenha kūūnū, kū sī īyo naalī naabilahīlīla bakūlūgenji bing'we gīkī nakūbinha. Naalī nahaya gīkī, ‘Natalalīkenaagūla ī lilagane lyane ū kū bing'we, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hama na a bing'we yaya ū kūbeeja ilagane nabo a banhū ba mu sī yenīyī; nūmukomeleja kwīkenaagūla gete ī myalīlo yabo.’ Alīyo ng'walekile ū kūniigwa. Nibūlī ng'wītile gīko? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū leki namuwīle, ī haha natūbapeeja bang'wīngīle; bakūbiza ming'hwa ū mu mbazu jiing'we, hama a baamulungu babo nabo bakūbiza lūtu lwa kūmugwasha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Malaika o ng'wa Seeba aho wabawīla a Baisilaeli ī mihayo yose yenīyī, būlīla ng'hūngū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī lipandī lyenīlo būlitana Bokimu;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2:5",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Bokimu:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Makūlū gaho, balīji ba ng'hūngū.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " hūna būmfunīja shitambò ū SEEBA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mihayo ya kū būkalīkījo bo shikū ja ng'wa Yoshwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū lūshikū lwene ū Yoshwa aho wabalagaga a Baisilaeli, bahayīnga a henaho būja būlī bene kūdima sī ya wingīji wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū būntūmamīla SEEBA ū mu shikū ja būlamu o ng'wa Yoshwa ī jose, hamò nī ja bataale abo akabaleka ho ū Yoshwa, abo baalī bīībona pyī īyo SEEBA walī wabīītīla a Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yoshwa ū ntūmami o ng'wa SEEBA ūcha alī na būlamu wa myaka igana na ikūmi līmò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būnjīka ū mu sī ya wingīji wakwe, mu nzengo gwa Timuna-sela, mu sī ya magūlya ya banhū ba lūganda lwa Efulaimu, sukuma ya lūgūlū lwa ng'wa Gaashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū ba shibyalīlwe shenīsho aho baakumingwa pye a bose kū bataale babo, shikilonga shibyalīlwe shingī, īsho shaalī shitandeebile ū SEEBA, nūūlū īyo walī wabīītīla a Baisilaeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Baisilaeli kūgwa mu būbi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū a Baisilaeli bandya kwīta yamalofu ū kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA, būyūgalamya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2:11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kūgalamya:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, kūgatūmamīla.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Maabaalī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būng'wība gete ū Seeba ū Mulungu wa bakūlūgenji babo, ūyo walī wabīnja mu sī ya Misili. Būyūlondeela na kūtūmamīla baamulungu ba būlī mbika ba mahanga ayo biikalaga hamò nago. Bakansayīcha no ū Seeba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nguno bakaneka būbiza balamya ba ng'wa Baalī na Maashitaloti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū īkī ū Seeba akabapelanīla a Baisilaeli, akabatūūla mu makono ga biboneeji, būyūbiboneela. Ūbajinja kū banishi babo abo baalī babapīndīlīgije hose hose; būlemeelwa gete ū kūbaheeba a banishi benabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yūbiza būlī ikanza ūlū baaja kū būlūūgū a Baisilaeli, ū nkono go ng'wa Seeba gwilwishaga nabo gīkī bapyenwe gīt'ūmo walī wabahūgūlīla. Bakabiza mu kwihīga kūtaale no.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "SEEBA kūbatūūlīla balamuji",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike makanza malebe na malebe ū Seeba wababūūkījaga balamuji,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2:16",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Balamuji:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, batongeeji; banhū baasolagwa na Mulungu kūbiza basugi nūūlū batongeeji, ū mu shikū jenījo ng'wihanga lya Baisilaeli.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kūlwa kūbapīja kūbīnja ū mu makono ga biboneeji benabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo baalī batabadegelekaga na a balamuji babo nguno ya būmalahya wabo, wa kwikala bakūtūmamīlaga baamulungu bangī. A banhū benabo bakagalūka wangū no, bīnga gete ū mu nzīla īyo babyaji babo bashimizīlaga; booya ū kwīta ūmo bīītīlaga a babyaji babo, ū kūshidīīlīīla ī shilagīlo sha ng'wa Seeba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būl'ikanza ū Seeba wabizaga ūlū wababūkīja namuji, walī hamò nū namuji ng'wenūyo; na lūūlū ū ng'wikanza lyose īlo walī mu sī hamò nabo ū namuji ng'wenūyo, wabapījaga kūfuma ū mu makono ga banishi babo; nguno ū SEEBA wabasaatagwa no ūlū wabalīja ū būluhi ūbo biboneeji babo baabūtūmamīlaga kūbaluhya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūlū waacha dūhū ū namuji ng'wenūyo, ī likanza lyenīlo baashokaga kū mihayo yamalofu kūtinda ūmo baalī a baasaabo; baalondeelaga baamulungu bangī na kūbatūmamīla, hamò na kūbalamya. A banhū benabo baalī baalema gete ū kūjileka ī nhūngwa jabo ī jabūbi nū būdiimu wa ntwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Seeba akabapelanīla no a Baisilaeli ūhaya gīkī, “A banhū ba ihanga lyenīlī īkī baalīkenaagūlile ī lilagane īlo naalī naabatūūlīla a bakūlūgenji babo, na baalemile gete ū kūnidegeleka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī haha lūūlū natūbīngījaga nūūlū līmò ū mu mahanga ayo akagaleka Yoshwa aho waacha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūgatūmamīla kūbalola a Baisilaeli nababone, ūlū bakwīdima ī nzīla ya ng'wa Seeba bashimizīle mo gīt'ūmo bīītīlaga bakūlūgenji babo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Seeba ūgazunīlīja a mahanga genanyo kwikala ho; atagapeegije haho na haho mu nzīla ya ng'wa Yoshwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
